<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE OF PAKISTAN TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE OF PAKISTAN TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of the Golden Jubilee of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p> Germany   3  Netherlands  1</p>
<p> Play-off for third place</p>
<p> Pakistan  7  Australia    4</p>
